# Markdown is left to authors. Prettier normalises emphasis, and these docs
# carry bare identifiers with underscores in prose — aiwa_*, sparxstar_*,
# sparx_dict_*, starmus_* — which it rewrites into emphasis markers, changing
# documented field names. It reaches inside inline code too: in the debranding
# migration plan `sparx_dict_*` became `sparx*dict*_`. It also formats embedded
# ```jsx fences as standalone expressions and appends semicolons, which makes
# the AIWA-Dictionary-Direction snippets invalid where they are meant to be
# pasted into a JSX return.
*.md
